      "product_summary": "Low-top lace-up casual walking shoes with stitched toe panels and a layered sole sidewall. Color options: Black. Confirmed EU size labels 39-48; confirm the size chart and fit before ordering. Send your color and size mix, pair quantity, packaging requirements and destination for a quotation. Material composition, availability, final price and dispatch timing are confirmed for each order. Sample availability and customization feasibility require review before confirmation. This listing has one Black color option and no separate online lining selector. Regular mesh-textured and fleece-textured lining options are shown; specify your lining version when enquiring. Listed prices are references, not a confirmed common price for both lining versions. Confirm the requested version and final quotation before ordering.",
      "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China and serves overseas B2B footwear buyers. Company images show general company-level development, production, checking and order coordination activities. Product-specific specifications, availability and services are confirmed after receiving your order requirements."
